WEBVTT

00:22:58.963 --> 00:23:00.376
in the digital age.

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:03.593
Learn more at Accenture.com/careers.

00:23:09.417 --> 00:23:13.167
(Musical interlude)

00:23:23.912 --> 00:23:27.806
Carmen Medina: I used to
describe myself as a heretic,

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:29.533
because I'm a heretic.

00:23:29.557 --> 00:23:32.766
I like the word because it means someone
whose views are different